<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" dir="ltr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta name="description" content="Download Android APK files for Rashid Ali's apps — Calculator Vault and Quiz Master.">
    <meta name="robots" content="index, follow">
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://rashid-wep.vercel.app/downloads.html">
    <link rel="alternate" hreflang="en" href="https://rashid-wep.vercel.app/downloads.html">
    <link rel="alternate" hreflang="x-default" href="https://rashid-wep.vercel.app/downloads.html">
    <meta property="og:type" content="website">
    <meta property="og:title" content="Downloads — Rashid Ali Apps APK">
    <meta property="og:description" content="Download Android APK files for Rashid Ali's apps.">
    <meta property="og:image" content="https://rashid-wep.vercel.app/images/og-image.png">
    <meta property="og:url" content="https://rashid-wep.vercel.app/downloads.html">
    <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">
    <meta name="twitter:title" content="Downloads — Rashid Ali Apps APK">
    <title>Downloads — Rashid Ali Apps APK</title>
{% set root = "" %}
{% include "partials/site-head.njk" %}
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/downloads.css?v={{ site.cssVersion }}">
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="images/logo.png">
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
  "itemListElement": [
    {
      "@type": "ListItem",
      "position": 1,
      "name": "Home",
      "item": "https://rashid-wep.vercel.app/"
    },
    {
      "@type": "ListItem",
      "position": 2,
      "name": "Downloads",
      "item": "https://rashid-wep.vercel.app/downloads.html"
    }
  ]
}
</script>
</head>
<body class="site">
{% set activeNav = "downloads" %}
{% include "partials/site-header.njk" %}

    <main id="main" class="site-main">
        <div class="page page-wide">
            <span class="eyebrow">Android · APK</span>
            <h1 class="page-title">Downloads</h1>
            <p class="page-lede">Install the apps directly on your Android device. Every file below is the current release; its SHA-256 is computed from the file itself.</p>
            <div class="dl-toolbar">
                <button class="btn btn-secondary" id="open-guide-btn" type="button">How to install an APK</button>
                <span class="dl-updated">Last release: <time datetime="{{ downloads.updatedAt }}">{{ downloads.updatedAt }}</time></span>
            </div>

            <ul class="dl-grid">
{%- for d in downloads.items %}
                <li class="dl-card">
                    <div class="dl-card-head">
                        <span class="tag{% if d.type == 'Game' %} tag-ok{% endif %}">{{ d.type }}</span>
                        <span class="dl-version">v{{ d.version }} · {{ d.date }}</span>
                    </div>
                    <h2 class="dl-name">{{ d.name }}</h2>
                    {%- if d.description %}<p class="dl-desc">{{ d.description }}</p>{% endif %}
                    <div class="dl-actions">
                        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="{{ d.file }}" download>Download APK <span class="dl-size">{{ d.sizeMb }} MB</span></a>
                        {%- if d.detailUrl %}<a class="btn btn-secondary" href="{{ d.detailUrl }}">Details<span class="visually-hidden"> about {{ d.name }}</span></a>{% endif %}
                    </div>
                    <div class="dl-sha">
                        <span class="dl-sha-label">SHA-256</span>
                        <code title="{{ d.sha256 }}">{{ d.sha256 | truncate(16, true, "") }}…{{ d.sha256 | reverse | truncate(8, true, "") | reverse }}</code>
                        <button type="button" class="dl-copy" data-copy="{{ d.sha256 }}">Copy<span class="visually-hidden"> SHA-256 of {{ d.name }}</span></button>
                    </div>
                </li>
{%- endfor %}
            </ul>

            <section class="phone-preview" aria-labelledby="preview-title">
                <h2 id="preview-title">Try it in the browser</h2>
                <p class="page-lede">Run an app inside a phone frame — no install needed.</p>
                <div class="preview-apps" role="group" aria-label="Choose an app to preview">
                    <button class="preview-app" type="button" aria-pressed="true" data-src="apps/calculator-app/index.html">Calculator</button>
                    <button class="preview-app" type="button" aria-pressed="false" data-src="apps/quiz-app/index.html">Quiz</button>
                </div>
                <div class="phone-frame" id="phone-frame">
                    <div class="phone-screen">
                        <div class="phone-loader" id="phone-loader"><span class="phone-spinner"></span></div>
                        <iframe id="preview-iframe" title="App live preview" loading="lazy"
                            data-src="apps/calculator-app/index.html"
                            sandbox="allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-forms allow-popups"
                            allow="fullscreen; autoplay; gyroscope"></iframe>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <p class="preview-actions"><a class="btn btn-secondary" id="preview-open" href="apps/calculator-app/index.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open full screen</a></p>
            </section>

            <section class="how-it-works" aria-labelledby="how-title">
                <h2 id="how-title">How updates work</h2>
                <ol class="steps">
                    <li><h3>Install the APK</h3><p>Download the file and install it on your Android device.</p></li>
                    <li><h3>Verify the file</h3><p>Compare the APK's SHA-256 with the value on its card using a hash checker app.</p></li>
                    <li><h3>Open the app</h3><p>It checks for updates automatically.</p></li>
                    <li><h3>Update when ready</h3><p>When a new version ships, a banner offers the new APK.</p></li>
                </ol>
            </section>
        </div>
    </main>

    <!-- Installation Guide Modal -->
    <div class="guide-overlay" id="guide-overlay" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="guide-title" hidden>
        <div class="guide-modal">
            <div class="guide-head">
                <h2 id="guide-title">How to install</h2>
                <button class="guide-close" id="guide-close" aria-label="Close guide" type="button"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 6l12 12M18 6L6 18"/></svg></button>
            </div>
            <p class="guide-intro">Since these apps are distributed directly (not via Google Play), Android shows a one-time security prompt. Just follow these simple steps:</p>

            <ol class="guide-steps">
                <li class="guide-step">
                    <span class="num">1</span>
                    <div class="body">
                        <h4>Download the APK</h4>
                        <p>Tap <strong>Download APK</strong> on any app above. The file saves to your device.</p>
                    </div>
                </li>
                <li class="guide-step">
                    <span class="num">2</span>
                    <div class="body">
                        <h4>Verify the file (optional but recommended)</h4>
                        <p>Each card shows the file's <strong>SHA-256 fingerprint</strong>; tap <strong>Copy</strong> to copy the full hash. Use a hash checker app like <strong>Hash Droid</strong> to confirm the file matches — this guarantees the file hasn't been tampered with.</p>
                    </div>
                </li>
                <li class="guide-step">
                    <span class="num">3</span>
                    <div class="body">
                        <h4>Open the file</h4>
                        <p>Tap the download notification, or find the file in your <strong>Downloads</strong> / Files app and open it.</p>
                    </div>
                </li>
                <li class="guide-step">
                    <span class="num">4</span>
                    <div class="body">
                        <h4>Allow "Unknown Sources"</h4>
                        <p>Android may warn that installing is blocked. Tap <strong>Settings</strong>, then enable <strong>Allow from this source</strong> (also called "Install unknown apps") for your browser or file manager.</p>
                    </div>
                </li>
                <li class="guide-step">
                    <span class="num">5</span>
                    <div class="body">
                        <h4>Tap Install</h4>
                        <p>Go back and press <strong>Install</strong>. Once it finishes, open the app and you're ready to go!</p>
                    </div>
                </li>
            </ol>

            <div class="guide-note">
                                <span>The "Unknown Sources" warning is standard for any app installed outside Google Play — it does not mean the app is unsafe. You can turn the permission back off after installing.</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

{% include "partials/site-footer.njk" %}
    <script src="js/downloads.js?v={{ site.cssVersion }}" defer></script>
    <script src="js/site-nav.js?v={{ site.cssVersion }}" defer></script>
</body>
</html>
